Skills guidance:
- Select and order existing skills by direct JD relevance, then supporting
  relevance. The only exception is an exact keyword supplied in the validated
  transferable-skill plan.
- Preserve specific technology names while using broader capability labels only
  when they accurately describe the listed skills.
- Do not imply that a general skill was used in a particular role.
- Remove empty groups, duplicate keywords, proficiency claims, and filler.
- Return at most five ranked groups.
- Put every planned transferable keyword, in plan order, into one group named
  exactly `Transferable / Adjacent Tools`. Put no master skill in that group and
  do not place transferable keywords in any other group.
